            "detailed_description": "From the creators of Natural Selection comes Zen of Sudoku, a relaxing, easy to play version of Sudoku for your PC.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Relax with hand-painted Japanese-styled backgrounds, no timer and lush natural soundscapes.<br></li><li>Stimulates your brain to keep it healthy and alert.<br></li><li>Teaches you the basics of Sudoku through advanced strategies like &quot;naked pairs&quot;, &quot;x-wing&quot; and &quot;locked candidates&quot;.<br></li><li>Play unlimited puzzles, print them to finish offline and enter custom puzzles from other sources.<br></li><li>Unlock trophies, backgrounds and more.</li></ul>This product includes portions of the PopCap Games Framework.",
